  "keyFeatures": [
    "No AI required for detection — uses NLP and semantic embeddings",
    "Sentence-level claim extraction and verification",
    "Semantic similarity scoring via SentenceTransformers (all-MiniLM-L6-v2)",
    "Number conflict detection (catches numeric hallucinations)",
    "Negation mismatch detection using negspacy",
    "Web scraping for URL-based truth sources (including Wikipedia API)",
    "Math claim verification via sympy",
    "Integrates with LangGraph, CrewAI, PydanticAI, and AutoGen pipelines",
    "Interactive TUI powered by Rich",
    "Four claim statuses: SUPPORTED, WEAK_SUPPORT, CONTRADICTION, HALLUCINATION"
  ],
